WEBVTT

00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:15,170
Taking my supplements, can I take them with meals most of them?

00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:20,330
Yes, most of the supplements that you're taking, you could take them with meals, sometimes

00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:23,010
that can be easier on your stomach.

00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:30,010
The ones that are binders, typically I ask you to not take them with a meal, but I have said

00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:34,310
take that 30 minutes away from food or something like that, whole meal paths you have to take

00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:35,870
away from food.

00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:41,190
So there are certain ones that I ask you to take on a relatively empty stomach, then just

00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:43,270
please follow that example.

00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:48,190
If you're on a high dose enzyme therapy, you take that on an empty stomach.

00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:51,430
So just follow those instructions.

00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:56,550
Anyone else who are any other supplements who doesn't say that you have to take it on an

00:00:56,550 --> 00:01:04,510
empty stomach, you could assume that you couldn't take it with food in general, for sure.

